{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">後天是中秋節，海洋公園為園內的大熊貓準備了特製的「月餅」，提前慶祝。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大熊貓「盈盈」與一對龍鳳胎「加加」和「得得」，享用園方準備的「月餅」拼盤，用了高纖維餅乾、紅蘿蔔、竹筍以及冰塊等，砌出月亮和玉兔等形狀，上面刻有「中秋節快樂」的字樣，三隻大熊貓都吃得津津有味。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PANDA-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026zgvHziHjWg1790137377.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PANDA-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">爸爸「樂樂」就獨自享用一個玉兔燈籠形狀的果盤，由西瓜、零食以及冰塊等砌成。不過，「樂樂」似乎對竹筍更感興趣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PANDA-1200_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026bVAouLTtvA1790137394.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PANDA-1200_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T04:58:55.429787+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}